00:47:09,118 --> 00:47:10,578
Untung, aku berhasil mendapatkannya!

845
00:47:10,703 --> 00:47:13,998
Ayo kita dengar, kawan. A, B...

846
00:47:14,123 --> 00:47:15,500
ADA...

847
